---
/**
 * /acoustic-soundproofing-flooring — Acoustic & Soundproofing Flooring hub (Dubai).
 *
 * This route is intentionally a dedicated page rather than the YAML-driven
 * generic HubPage, so the `acoustic` hub is excluded from getStaticPaths in
 * src/pages/[...slug].astro to avoid a route collision.
 *
 * NOTE (redesign): per an explicit later instruction this page's metadata,
 * <h1> and FAQ set were re-authored to a Dubai-focused brief and now
 * intentionally DIVERGE from src/content/hubs/acoustic.yaml (which still
 * carries the older UAE-wide "…Solutions in the UAE" copy consumed by nav and
 * the four child product pages). Keep that YAML in mind if those need to match.
 *
 * Body copy is reproduced verbatim from the supplied content brief. Notes:
 *  - The "Trusted Local Supply" block is authored as H3 in the source; promoted
 *    to H2 here to keep a strict H1 -> H2 -> H3 outline (CLAUDE.md §1).
 *  - Source "Explore Product" links point at google.com/search URLs that embed
 *    internal slugs; mapped to the real product routes (CLAUDE.md §6).
 *  - public/ images use <img> (astro:assets <Image /> only optimises
 *    src/assets). Explicit width/height + lazy loading keep CLS/perf in check.
 */
